<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.2 Impact of Internalizing Structured Reasoning via Fine-Tuning ‣ 4 Results and Analysis ‣ Improving Large Language Models Function Calling and Interpretability via Guided-Structured Templates" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Broad Applicability Across Different Models</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
