<span id="A1.T9.2.4.2.1.2" class="ltx_p">Given Thinking Process or Analysis:<span id="A1.T9.2.4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">{ROUND 1 THINKING}</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
